<title>CHILE: Chilean shares end firm in volatile trade.</title>
<headline>Chilean shares end firm in volatile trade.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chilean blue chips ended stronger on Friday but off the day's high as heavyweight electrical Endesa buckled under a wave of profit-taking, said traders.</p>
<p>The bolsa is seen opening weaker with fresh falls expected in Endesa as foreign buyers cash in gains, they said.</p>
<p>&quot;Endesa could find a new support level around 243 pesos,&quot; said one dealer.</p>
</text>
